@startuml ssd-UC05

title SSD - UC05 Check In Member
hide footbox
actor "Reception staff" as Staff
participant ":System" as S
actor "Access system" as Access

note over Staff : temporary cover staff use the same event\nbut don't see plan, allowance or charge details (BR02)

Staff -> S : checkInMember(memberNumber)

alt booking found for today
  S --> Staff : arrival recorded (booking, arrival time)
else no booking for today
  S --> Staff : no booking for today
  note right : not decided - CQ08
else member number not found
  S --> Staff : member number not found
end

note over S, Access : what the system sends to the Access system is not confirmed

note over Staff, Access : SC05 = success path, as temporary cover staff

@enduml